OL,3,GNEWSATen-minute favour leads to 50
OL,4,Ayears behind the bar
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pub regular who was asked to help
OL,7,Fserve a rush of customers 50 years ago,
OL,8,Fsupposedly for 10 minutes, has ended up
OL,9,Fworking as a barman there ever since.
OL,11,FIn 1976, Glyn Jones suddenly found
OL,12,Fhimself pulling pints at The Prince
OL,13,FAlbert in Ely, Cambridgeshire.
OL,15,FHalf a century later, he is still
OL,16,Fbehind the bar Thursday to Sunday -
OL,17,Fdressed in his shirt, novelty tie and
OL,18,Fbraces - with no plans to retire
OL,19,Fanytime soon.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
